    "description": "Move-in ready! Updated single-family home in the highly sought-after Outer Sunset. Both bedrooms are spacious and overlook the deep & inviting backyard. Beautiful hardwood floors and recessed lighting provide the main level with a nice refined feel. Natural light floods the tastefully remodeled kitchen. An elegant bathroom is situated off the interior stairs. Abundant space for storage and laundry is found on the lower level. 1870 44th is ideally situated around the corner from the best shops along Noriega, and just a few blocks from tons of amenities such as great schools, a public library, Ocean Beach, and Golden Gate Park. If you are searching for a move-in ready home in a quintessential Outer Sunset location, look no further. Come check it out, and call it your home!"
